      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "八个实例地下城要求组队挑战，并以独特稀有战利品作为回报",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "8 instance dungeons - bring friends to tackle these challenges for unique rare loot.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2506440/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "手工世界与程序生成并存，每天由传送门开放一个从未到访的新世界",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Mix of handcrafted and generated worlds and dungeons - every day Junjun the Portal Master will open up a gateway to another world that has never been visited before.",
